{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/074",
  "family": "STA60"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u14026",
   "en": "We lost our heads. We just couldn't let an opportunity like this pass us by.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14027",
   "en": "But it doesn't matter now. I just want to live. I don't care if I ever see that data again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14028",
   "en": "I won't-- or I will. Stick to research, that is. Thank you. Goodbye.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14029",
   "en": "I will-- I mean, I won't see you again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14030",
   "en": "So, what do you want to do about Jahleed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14031",
   "en": "What? No! Please!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14032",
   "en": "What data? What are you talking about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14033",
   "en": "If you see me again, it'll be the last thing you see.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14034",
   "en": "Let's go have a talk with our chubby friend.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14035",
   "en": "I'm gonna show him what happens to people who lie to me!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14036",
   "en": "I'll speak with him later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14037",
   "en": "Don't worry, you won't. Nobody attacks me and walks away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14038",
   "en": "Who are you? What do you want?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14039",
   "en": "Drop your weapons. Now!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14040",
   "en": "We don't have what you're looking for.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14041",
   "en": "There's no need to let things get out of hand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14042",
   "en": "Come and get it, salarian. It'll be the last mistake you make.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14043",
   "en": "Why shouldn't I kill you right here? Why are you willing to die for this data?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14044",
   "en": "What's so important about this data? Why are you trying to get it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14045",
   "en": "Sorry, I can't put my gun away until the job is done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14046",
   "en": "So you're just trying to get back what Jahleed already stole.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14047",
   "en": "I should kill both of you idiots.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14048",
   "en": "I suggest you stick to research and leave the espionage to the rest of us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14049",
   "en": "Data?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14050",
   "en": "Back down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14051",
   "en": "There is no data.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14052",
   "en": "Let's talk about this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14053",
   "en": "Over my dead body.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_UNC52_05_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14054",
   "en": "Convince me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14055",
   "en": "(sigh)",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14056",
   "en": "You're not leaving.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14057",
   "en": "Time for a chat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14058",
   "en": "I'm gonna kill him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14059",
   "en": "Leave him for now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14060",
   "en": "So why is this data so valuable?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14061",
   "en": "Why is this data so valuable?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14062",
   "en": "What's so important about this data?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14063",
   "en": "What makes the data so valuable?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14064",
   "en": "What about Jahleed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14065",
   "en": "What do we do about the lying volus?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14066",
   "en": "What should we do about Jahleed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14067",
   "en": "What about the volus? What should we do with him?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14068",
   "en": "Boys.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14069",
   "en": "It's the initial data. From scanning the keepers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14070",
   "en": "You see. We stole some research from our work, to make the scanners.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14071",
   "en": "We were supposed to work together. I get the data, he analyzes it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14072",
   "en": "Commander. I wasn't expecting to see you again. Is there something you want?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14073",
   "en": "I'm not sure what you're referring to. My experiments are...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14074",
   "en": "We're not buying it. Jahleed told us you've been after him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14075",
   "en": "Quit stalling. Your friend Jahleed told us about you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14076",
   "en": "Your lies are catching up with you. We spoke with your friend, Jahleed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14077",
   "en": "Quit stalling. Jahleed told us what you've been up to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14078",
   "en": "Quit stalling. Jahleed told us you've been after him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14079",
   "en": "You... spoke with Jahleed? Then you know about the data?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14080",
   "en": "You boys can go.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14081",
   "en": "Looks like my plans have changed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14082",
   "en": "It's not as bad as you think, Commander. Jahleed and I just got a little... over our heads.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14083",
   "en": "The company we work for developed an experimental procedure for use in medical scanners.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14084",
   "en": "Jahleed and I saw even more potential. So we stole the plans and secretly developed a tool to scan the keepers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14085",
   "en": "Can you imagine? A tool that can actually get readings from the keepers?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14086",
   "en": "Don't you see? We were the first to scan them. Ever!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14087",
   "en": "You've seen it yourself, Commander. You know we can do it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14088",
   "en": "I'm not trying to kill him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14089",
   "en": "Jahleed's job was to disseminate our initial findings.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14090",
   "en": "But... he decided to keep the data for himself. Maybe to sell it. I don't know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14091",
   "en": "Commander. If you'll just continue gathering data for me... imagine what we might learn.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14092",
   "en": "And you'll stand to make a bit of profit yourself, remember.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14093",
   "en": "All right. You don't need to ask twice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14094",
   "en": "Well then, no more scanning. I promise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14095",
   "en": "Of course, Jahleed still has the initial data and I doubt he's planning to return it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14096",
   "en": "Very good. Maybe if you wouldn't mind speaking with Jahleed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14097",
   "en": "The data you're gathering for me is useless if Jahleed won't help me analyze it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14098",
   "en": "Thank you, and happy scanning, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14099",
   "en": "It's not difficult, really.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14100",
   "en": "Just get within range and scan them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14101",
   "en": "You seem interested. Enough to help me perhaps?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14102",
   "en": "I'll give you my scanner.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14103",
   "en": "Whenever you see a keeper, scan it. Discretely.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14104",
   "en": "My database will update automatically each time you scan a unique keeper. Then I'll update your account with a few credits.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14105",
   "en": "And what exactly was I supposed to be delivering?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14106",
   "en": "You can start by telling me the truth, Chorban.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14107",
   "en": "Drop the act. I want to know what's going on, Chorban.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14108",
   "en": "Just tell me everything you know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14109",
   "en": "No. But you're going to tell me. Everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14110",
   "en": "That's what all the fuss is about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14111",
   "en": "What's so special about that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14112",
   "en": "Why are you trying to kill your partner?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14113",
   "en": "That doesn't explain why you're trying to kill your partner.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14114",
   "en": "I'm not breaking regulations for you or your research. Return what you stole, or I'll have you arrested.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14115",
   "en": "I'll deal with Jahleed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14116",
   "en": "If it'll help further the scientific cause, how can I refuse?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14117",
   "en": "I suppose a little scanning here and there won't hurt anyone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14118",
   "en": "If I have time, I'll talk to him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14119",
   "en": "I'll go have a chat with right now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14120",
   "en": "So how do you gather data on the keepers?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14121",
   "en": "How could I help you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14122",
   "en": "Did he know?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14123",
   "en": "He said that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14124",
   "en": "I'm not sure I follow.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14125",
   "en": "The truth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14126",
   "en": "No more lies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14127",
   "en": "I want answers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14128",
   "en": "And Jahleed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14129",
   "en": "No more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14130",
   "en": "Get moving.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14131",
   "en": "He won't get away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14132",
   "en": "Scanning?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14133",
   "en": "So long, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14134",
   "en": "Hold it. That's close enough, army.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_02b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14135",
   "en": "You got my payment?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
