    "BIOA_STA60_03quarian_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14166",
   "en": "I know how to look after myself. Not that I don't appreciate the help. Who are you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_STA60_03quarian_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u14167",
   "en": "Then I guess there are two things I need to thank you for. Who are you?",
